<title>USA: Tecnol Medical pays $1 mln for mask line.</title>
<headline>Tecnol Medical pays $1 mln for mask line.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tecnol Medical Products Inc said Tuesday it has acquired a line of face masks from Ballard Medical Products for about $1 million.</p>
<p>The masks, known as Safety Shield, are used primarily in hospitals and other health-care sites.</p>
<p>Tecnol purchased the manufacturing equipment, trademark, goodwill, related intangibles and about $250,000 in inventory related to the product line.</p>
</text>
